{"id":"f14193aff07acd49","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-elementary-amalgamation.md","title":"Amalgamation","display":"df-elementary-amalgamation — Amalgamation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-elementary-amalgamation","aliases":["17-df-elementary-amalgamation"],"display":"df-elementary-amalgamation — Amalgamation","depends_on":["[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[17-df-set-functions]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-df-3.2.1","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-elementary-amalgamation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-elementary-amalgamation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-amalgamation — Amalgamation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-3.2.1"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_1,f_2\">\\(f_1,f_2\\)</span> 为候选集合函数图。下式检验其源结构、目标结构及初等性。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_1,\\mathfrak{B}_2\">\\(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_1,\\mathfrak{B}_2\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L\\)</span> (elementary embeddings, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\">\\(\\circ\\)</span> (function composition, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Amalgamable}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Amalgamable}_L\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\operatorname{Amalgamable}_L\n(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_1,\\mathfrak{B}_2;f_1,f_2)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\\nf_1\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_1)\n\\land\nf_2\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_2)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7mm}\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak{C}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\exists g_1\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{B}_1,\\mathfrak{C})\\;\n\\exists g_2\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{B}_2,\\mathfrak{C})\\;\n(g_1\\circ f_1=g_2\\circ f_2).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\operatorname{Amalgamable}_L\n(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_1,\\mathfrak{B}_2;f_1,f_2)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\\nf_1\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_1)\n\\land\nf_2\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_2)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7mm}\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak{C}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\exists g_1\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{B}_1,\\mathfrak{C})\\;\n\\exists g_2\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{B}_2,\\mathfrak{C})\\;\n(g_1\\circ f_1=g_2\\circ f_2).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The maps <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_1\">\\(f_1\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_2\">\\(f_2\\)</span> have the common source <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span>; the maps <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_1\">\\(g_1\\)</span>\nand <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_2\">\\(g_2\\)</span> then embed the two target structures into a common amalgam.  This\norientation makes both composites well typed.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-set-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_1,\\mathfrak{B}_2$ ($L$-structures, see [[17-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L$ (elementary embeddings, see [[17-df-elementary-embedding]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\circ$ (function composition, see [[17-df-set-functions]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"f_1,f_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_1,\\mathfrak{B}_2","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Amalgamable}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&\\operatorname{Amalgamable}_L\n(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_1,\\mathfrak{B}_2;f_1,f_2)\n\\\\\n&\\leftrightarrow\\\nf_1\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_1)\n\\land\nf_2\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}_2)\n\\\\\n&\\hspace{7mm}\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak{C}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\exists g_1\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{B}_1,\\mathfrak{C})\\;\n\\exists g_2\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{B}_2,\\mathfrak{C})\\;\n(g_1\\circ f_1=g_2\\circ f_2).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f_1","di